  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "It would be incredibly useful to be able to have a flat surface be able to receive whether it’s been collided with, and with either a specific direction it's being entered from or if it's being entered from either side. If it would have to be strictly Constant and OnEnter receiver types to not have to worry about calculating distance that would be fine, but some things just can’t be done with a Sphere/Capsule.\nLess we set up some absurd grid array of sphere’s or capsule's to substitute and have to check for 1000’s if not 10,000’s of colliders.",
